WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:03.795
Where are your sons? Are they good?

00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:05.755
They left to find work.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:09.009
-So who'll do the design?
-Fio.

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:12.012
Fio? That little girl?

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:16.766
She's young, but she's got
something my sons don't.

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:26.317
I've known you a long time,
but I think I'll try somewhere else.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:29.112
Wait!

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:38.455
It is because I'm a girl?
Or because I'm young?

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:40.498
Both, actually.

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:42.917
Well, I can understand that.

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:47.505
Tell me, what's the main thing
a good pilot needs?

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:50.258
Experience?

00:00:50.341 --> 00:00:52.260
No. Inspiration.

00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:55.305
I'm glad you didn't say experience.

00:00:55.805 --> 00:01:00.268
Grandpa says you were very young
when you first soloed.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:03.271
You were good from the start.

00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:07.358
That was 1910. I was 17.

00:01:08.359 --> 00:01:10.820
I'm 17 too!

00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:16.284
I can't help being a girl,
but we've got your old blueprints.

00:01:16.951 --> 00:01:20.288
If it's no good, you don't have to pay.
Okay, Grandpa?

00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:23.083
She'll do fine.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:26.795
I was overhauling engines when I was 12.

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:28.630
Sleep on it.

00:01:28.713 --> 00:01:33.384
Shower's hot. Towels on the rack.
Breakfast at seven. Good night.

00:01:36.846 --> 00:01:41.684
You're short, but we're friends.
I'll loan you the rest.

